rooms on the first floor of Inky’s house. Drinking it lets you move fas","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T12:50:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701597","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3944590-1843481262699457","game_id":"steam-3944590","kind":"announcement","title":"Relocat is coming November 10!","summary":"We’re excited to share the official Relocat trailer—and announce that the game will be released on November 10, 2026! Watch the trailer to meet Inky and get a glimpse of the journey that awaits him in Boren.If you’d like to support the game, add Relocat to your wishlist and try the free demo. See you in November!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T12:25:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3944590-1842212951303248","game_id":"steam-3944590","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3","summary":"Hi everyone!Relocat will support both Xbox and PlayStation controllers.We’re currently adapting the controls, menus, and button prompts to make the game comfortable to play with a controller.Controller support will also be added to the demo in an upcoming update — coming very soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T13:34:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3944590-1836506165549877","game_id":"steam-3944590","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2","summary":"Hi!Over the past six months, Relocat has grown a lot. We’ve added many new mini-games, activities, and small details that we’d like to share with you.Mini-games and activitiesDuring this time, we’ve added several new things to do:ice skating races — take part in races on the ice and compete with other characters;cooking — Inki will be able to prepare different dishes;fishing — a calm activity for moments when you just want to slow down a little;a vinyl player — listen to music at home;records — ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T15:50:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165549877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3944590-1826992588598290","game_id":"steam-3944590","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog","summary":"Hi everyone! The game is progressing steadily and is still very much in active development.I wanted to share a few new features that will be in the full version of the game:1. Fishing I think this one needs no explanation. The fish you catch can be gifted or cooked.2. Cooking Mom’s Recipes While you’re far from home, Mom will send you recipes so you can feel a little piece of her warmth. The dishes you cook can also be given as gifts and will be needed for certain quests.3. Settling In Buy furni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-14T17:42:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588598290","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3944590-1823191198607868","game_id":"steam-3944590","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes #2","summary":"Hi everyone! The project is currently in active development of the full version, but we’ve also rolled out updates for the demo:Updated the quest with 